1
00:00:00,820 --> 00:00:05,887
This is you, standing on the Earth, minding your own business.

2
00:00:06,220 --> 00:00:10,553
Here is what happens if you fall into a black hole.

3
00:00:10,620 --> 00:00:16,109
The event horizon is the point of no return. Not even light gets out.

4
00:00:16,320 --> 00:00:22,653
Falling in, gravity stretches you into spaghetti, long before you reach the middle.

5
00:00:22,720 --> 00:00:28,187
But from outside, you never quite arrive. You fade, frozen, forever.
